{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-1809","published":"2026-04-03T11:10:49Z","modified":"2026-08-18T01:19:45.909183309Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-69720"],"summary":"ncurses security update","details":"The ncurses (new curses) library is a free software emulation of  curses in System V Release 4.0 (SVr4), and more. It uses terminfo  format, supports pads and color and multiple highlights and forms  characters and function-key mapping, and has all the other SVr4-curses  enhancements over BSD curses. SVr4 curses became the basis of X/Open Curses.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nThe infocmp command-line tool in ncurses before 6.5-20251213 has a stack-based buffer overflow in analyze_string in progs/infocmp.c.(CVE-2025-69720)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"ncurses","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/ncurses&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"6.4-11.oe2403"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["ncurses-6.4-11.oe2403.aarch64.rpm","ncurses-compat-libs-6.4-11.oe2403.aarch64.rpm","ncurses-debuginfo-6.4-11.oe2403.aarch64.rpm","ncurses-debugsource-6.4-11.oe2403.aarch64.rpm","ncurses-devel-6.4-11.oe2403.aarch64.rpm","ncurses-help-6.4-11.oe2403.aarch64.rpm","ncurses-libs-6.4-11.oe2403.aarch64.rpm","ncurses-static-6.4-11.oe2403.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["ncurses-base-6.4-11.oe2403.noarch.rpm"],"src":["ncurses-6.4-11.oe2403.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["ncurses-6.4-11.oe2403.x86_64.rpm","ncurses-compat-libs-6.4-11.oe2403.x86_64.rpm","ncurses-debuginfo-6.4-11.oe2403.x86_64.rpm","ncurses-debugsource-6.4-11.oe2403.x86_64.rpm","ncurses-devel-6.4-11.oe2403.x86_64.rpm","ncurses-help-6.4-11.oe2403.x86_64.rpm","ncurses-libs-6.4-11.oe2403.x86_64.rpm","ncurses-static-6.4-11.oe2403.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-1809.json"}}],"references":[{"type":"ADVISORY","url":"https://www.openeuler.org/zh/security/security-bulletins/detail/?id=openEuler-SA-202